    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b7e49822f7fb3be4b1c983",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "茶座小姐的表情总觉得有些严峻……\n有些令人担心呢，我们去向她搭话看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "704e2c1616596d7a31325d09465811678ef02b2337ea7c3c75210c24d50dcf61",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
