    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bac6402236f6a371bbdcf27",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "突然察觉到一股不祥的气息，\n于是走到了红色梦想的前面将她拦了下来——",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b89cf6d22c722c5648ccb745d803b17a80eacc6b7f3b97a6a31eb5743a02b3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
