    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c58191dacd283af36fd816b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呜呼，真是让人心旷神怡……\n仿佛身心都得到了洗涤。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b29e00bb2ca986481d25e787a4c6bb1f6d3b0d0f0ede8cb38b077e30df44776",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
