    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e224b25497f51205603437af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "巫女与圣女，皆为肩负神圣职责之人。\n我知道了。\n就由我红色梦想来帮忙吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5131475a8ba5d644a4355a274cdb6b819d5fdfeb62bedfb30e820b4eb3c9ba3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136707.json",
