      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵。\n训练员，您是在担心我吧。\n的确，我的身体还没有完全恢复。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09ead2937201a7049f9b18c9fe1fa15b47fb76d8f32d0f35f36ecb06337794a6",
